  <!-- One output root for every variant: out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\ for the
       binaries, with the compiler's intermediates under obj\ inside it. Pinned
       unconditionally and anchored on $(ProjectDir) so the DLL does not move
       depending on which solution drove the build. This replaces the x86-only
       overrides, under which x86 landed in Debug\ and x64 in x64\Debug\, plus the
       stray P2PmsgMFC\<Platform>\<Config>\ intermediate tree the old project format
       wrote beside the sources. -->
